// Tim Cain - 8007
{1}{[Tim Cain] That's enough you two, we're not here to fight amongst ourselves, we're here to figure out our next project.}{[Tim Cain] That's enough you two, we're not here to fight amongst ourselves, we're here to figure out our next project.}{}{}{}{gv2 8009, gv4 40}
{2}{[Tim Cain] Look, Fallout... Been there, done that. What's wrong with an old style RPG with magic anyway?}{[Tim Cain] Look, Fallout... Been there, done that. What's wrong with an old style RPG with magic anyway?}{}{}{}{gv2 8010, gv4 62}
{3}{[Tim Cain] Actually, neither of you should be listening to this, seeing as both of you have left..}{[Tim Cain] Actually, neither of you should be listening to this, seeing as both of you have left..}{}{}{}{gv2 8018, gv4 221}
{4}{[Tim Cain] Hmmmm.... Big sword?? I like it.. It's simple.. Effective... Okay, let's do it! What does everyone else think?}{[Tim Cain] Hmmmm.... Big sword?? I like it.. It's simple.. Effective... Okay, let's do it! What does everyone else think?}{}{}{}{gv2 8008, gv4 22}
{5}{[Tim Cain] Well then.. There's only one thing left to do.... Leonard, if you would be so honoured...}{[Tim Cain] Well then.. There's only one thing left to do.... Leonard, if you would be so honoured...}{}{}{}{gv2 8008, gv4 23}
{6}{[Tim Cain] Powerful and wise Sierra! We summon thee here to us today... Heed our call Sierra and appear before us!!}{[Tim Cain] Powerful and wise Sierra! We summon thee here to us today... Heed our call Sierra and appear before us!!}{}{}{}{gv2 8021, gv4 280}
{7}{[Tim Cain] That would be me, oh wise and powerful Sierra... I have a new RPG idea to discuss...}{[Tim Cain] That would be me, oh wise and powerful Sierra... I have a new RPG idea to discuss...}{}{}{}{gv2 8021, gv4 281}

