{22}{[Leonard Boyarsky] Well.... If we only have ONE big sword... It WOULD cut down on the art requirements... Okay, I'm for it.}{[Leonard Boyarsky] Well.... If we only have ONE big sword... It WOULD cut down on the art requirements... Okay, I'm for it.}{}{}{}{gv2 8009, gv4 42}
