{24}{[Leonard Boyarsky] Well we've got a good idea this time... It's about a hero.. With a big sword...}{[Leonard Boyarsky] Well we've got a good idea this time... It's about a hero.. With a big sword...}{}{}{}{gv2 8021, gv4 282}
